#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdlandmask.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdlandmask.grdlandmask:3
msgid ""
"Read the selected shoreline database and use that information to decide "
"which nodes in the specified grid are over land or over water. The nodes "
"defined by the selected region and lattice spacing will be set according to "
"one of two criteria: (1) land vs water, or (2) the more detailed "
"(hierarchical) ocean vs land vs lake vs island vs pond. A mask grid is "
"created with the specified grid spacing."
msgstr ""

